Apache-2.0 §4(b) requires derivative works to state what was
changed. The substantive changes in this fork are:

  * Replaced the single-shot "content in, page out" flow with a
    four-step pipeline (outline / cover / render / caption) so the
    page count and the text of every card are confirmed by the user
    before the expensive render runs.
  * Added src/lib/xhs/* — the step machine, its prompt builders, the
    multi-task store, and the SSE flow driver.
  * Added a JSON extractor (src/lib/extract-json.ts) so step ② can
    return a structured outline rather than HTML.
  * Rewrote src/lib/extract-html.ts to take the last complete
    document instead of splicing the first opening tag to the last
    closing one.
  * Added hard prompt rules for CJK typography, fixed-size card
    layout, and text/background contrast.
  * Added user-uploaded templates, a live-preview template gallery,
    per-card image attachments, and a user-supplied footer handle.
  * Added the Xiaohongshu card templates under
    src/lib/templates/skills/ and converted them all to 1080×1440.

Files inherited from html-anything and modified in place are noted
where the change is not obvious from the surrounding code.
